WEBVTT

00:00.225 --> 00:00.910
Researcher?

00:01.555 --> 00:01.926
You.

00:02.605 --> 00:03.441
Tab collector?

00:04.005 --> 00:04.342
You.

00:04.995 --> 00:05.471
Copy.

00:05.755 --> 00:06.173
Paste.

00:06.515 --> 00:07.015
Repeat.

00:08.175 --> 00:09.614
What if your browser could help carry

00:09.661 --> 00:10.125
the work?

00:11.325 --> 00:12.289
Meet TaffyGo.

00:12.625 --> 00:14.668
Your AI-native browser for Android.

00:15.825 --> 00:16.557
You browse.

00:17.375 --> 00:18.664
Taffy helps with the work.

00:21.375 --> 00:22.942
A form needs a photo under two

00:23.012 --> 00:23.929
hundred kilobytes.

00:24.225 --> 00:25.362
Your photo is too big.

00:25.725 --> 00:26.921
Just ask Taffy.

00:27.275 --> 00:29.376
Taffy fills your selected details.

00:29.775 --> 00:31.934
It resizes and compresses a copy on

00:31.981 --> 00:32.515
your phone.

00:33.125 --> 00:34.054
Then attaches it.

00:34.375 --> 00:36.152
Your original stays untouched.

00:36.475 --> 00:37.218
You review.

00:37.575 --> 00:38.307
You approve.

00:39.225 --> 00:40.339
Taffy submits.

00:43.325 --> 00:44.672
Built-in ad blocking.

00:45.025 --> 00:45.860
Fewer ads.

00:46.125 --> 00:47.065
Fewer trackers.

00:47.375 --> 00:48.606
More room for the page.

00:49.025 --> 00:51.208
Keep your tabs and saved pages close.

00:52.425 --> 00:54.492
Connect the AI provider you choose.

00:57.325 --> 00:59.078
Turn pages into something useful.

00:59.475 --> 01:01.031
Ask Taffy to collect a table from

01:01.101 --> 01:02.145
selected pages.

01:03.875 --> 01:04.966
Keep the source links.

01:05.575 --> 01:06.562
Save a spreadsheet.

01:07.475 --> 01:09.623
File processing happens on your device.

01:12.225 --> 01:14.036
Compare products across websites.

01:14.225 --> 01:16.675
Bring prices, specs, and reviews from multiple

01:16.710 --> 01:18.416
sources into one clear view.

01:20.225 --> 01:22.873
Spot downloadable videos across supported sites.

01:23.175 --> 01:25.125
Queue them in the download manager.

01:25.575 --> 01:27.235
Watch in the built-in player.

01:29.175 --> 01:30.568
TaffyGo SDK.

01:30.875 --> 01:33.290
On-device MCP and IPC.

01:33.575 --> 01:35.375
Let AI agents in other apps use

01:35.409 --> 01:37.174
your browser, with your permission.

01:40.375 --> 01:43.010
TaffyGo is being built as open-source software,

01:43.173 --> 01:44.937
under the Mozilla Public License.

01:45.125 --> 01:50.024
Developers, designers, translators, and curious testers: come

01:50.059 --> 01:50.883
build it with us.

01:51.275 --> 01:52.808
Make the browser you want to use.

01:53.275 --> 01:53.983
TaffyGo.

01:54.575 --> 01:55.910
Browse with a little help.
